    "regime_notes": "20-session horizon clears benchmark admission gates (absolute IC >= 0.0070 and absolute ICIR >= 0.0840). Five- and ten-session horizons fail ICIR. Small cross-asset cross-section implies conservative uncertainty interpretation; defensive use is preferable during stressed regimes.",
